{
  "_README": [
    "Maps medication names found by OCR to the risk model's input variables.",
    "Brand names are India-weighted alongside internationals, since a photographed",
    "box in India will show the brand far more prominently than the generic.",
    "",
    "'implies' names a Profile field. 'confidence' is how safely that inference holds:",
    "  high   - the drug is essentially only used for that condition",
    "  medium - common for it, but has other indications",
    "  signal - does NOT set the field; raises a question for the user to confirm",
    "",
    "Nothing here ever sets a model variable on its own. OCR proposes, the user confirms."
  ],
